WEBVTT

00:00:15.490 --> 00:00:17.100
You should take a break.

00:00:17.100 --> 00:00:19.230
You've been going nonstop.

00:00:21.860 --> 00:00:24.270
You can see the ocean from here.

00:00:24.620 --> 00:00:25.990
Yeah.

00:00:26.340 --> 00:00:29.250
But you won't get any customers here.

00:00:29.250 --> 00:00:31.070
Don't you know?

00:00:31.070 --> 00:00:33.710
This is a famous spot in Den City.

00:00:33.710 --> 00:00:37.450
While you were focused on your 
work, one customer came by.

00:00:37.820 --> 00:00:39.680
I asked a serious question.

00:00:39.680 --> 00:00:42.140
And I answered seriously.

00:00:42.880 --> 00:00:46.970
This ocean is called Stardust Road.

00:00:46.970 --> 00:00:48.680
Stardust Road?

00:00:48.680 --> 00:00:54.660
When luminescent plankton gather 
together, the ocean shines.

00:00:54.900 --> 00:00:58.140
This happens very rarely.

00:00:58.680 --> 00:01:04.240
But the customer lives on top of that cliff, 
so he may have seen it several times.

00:01:05.920 --> 00:01:08.050
Learn anything new?

00:01:08.050 --> 00:01:10.300
No.  Zero results.

00:01:10.300 --> 00:01:11.650
How about you?

00:01:12.430 --> 00:01:16.410
I tried tracking down SOL Technologies' 
staff from ten years ago,

00:01:16.410 --> 00:01:18.890
but all records were deleted.

00:01:18.890 --> 00:01:20.360
I see.

00:01:20.360 --> 00:01:22.970
We know the company was involved.

00:01:22.970 --> 00:01:26.870
But even someone with 
Zaizen's status didn't know.

00:01:27.140 --> 00:01:28.780
That means...

00:01:30.120 --> 00:01:38.310
To tell you the truth, I was relieved 
when I learned that Dr. Kogami was dead.

00:01:38.310 --> 00:01:42.880
Maybe our revenge is over.

00:01:43.550 --> 00:01:46.990
Kusanagi, I don't intend to give up.

00:01:46.990 --> 00:01:50.190
We still don't know the 
truth about the incident.

00:01:50.190 --> 00:01:51.840
You're right.

00:01:51.840 --> 00:01:55.530
I won't stop and leave 
my brother in darkness.

00:01:55.900 --> 00:01:59.110
But what can we do?  We have no leads.

00:02:04.460 --> 00:02:08.710
Yusaku left me behind again.

00:02:08.710 --> 00:02:12.440
Recently, the master often leaves on his own.

00:02:12.440 --> 00:02:16.670
He's probably making out 
with the hot dog guy.

00:02:16.670 --> 00:02:21.560
But since he's not here, we're 
free to do whatever we like.

00:02:21.560 --> 00:02:24.420
I'll tell you a fun story!

00:02:24.430 --> 00:02:27.260
Roboppi loves fun stories!

00:02:27.500 --> 00:02:30.670
You must be bored staying 
indoors all the time.

00:02:30.670 --> 00:02:35.080
And you're doing many secret 
things for me, so I'll tell you.

00:02:52.600 --> 00:02:55.720
I run Across the universe

00:02:55.870 --> 00:02:58.890
At the speed of light

00:02:59.300 --> 00:03:00.760
Begin Loading

00:03:01.000 --> 00:03:04.490
Open the door of dreams

00:03:05.010 --> 00:03:08.060
VRAINS spreads

00:03:08.310 --> 00:03:11.170
Believe in myself

00:03:11.410 --> 00:03:14.700
VRAINS continues

00:03:14.950 --> 00:03:20.010
The circuit draws the future

00:03:20.290 --> 00:03:24.080
I'll grab it with my own hands  Yeah

00:03:24.460 --> 00:03:25.680
Access!

00:03:25.760 --> 00:03:28.380
Start swirling, Data Storm!

00:03:28.660 --> 00:03:29.990
I'm now With the Wind

00:03:30.170 --> 00:03:32.290
Link with my soul

00:03:32.400 --> 00:03:35.060
Speed up, Data Storm!

00:03:35.270 --> 00:03:36.790
Now Win the Race

00:03:36.910 --> 00:03:39.630
Connected world

00:03:39.910 --> 00:03:43.130
No matter when

00:03:43.380 --> 00:03:46.500
Nothing is impossible

00:03:46.720 --> 00:03:50.640
Strive for hope

00:03:50.850 --> 00:03:55.210
And ride the wind!

00:04:10.430 --> 00:04:13.440
It all started with that lady.

00:04:13.440 --> 00:04:15.340
She made us suffer.

00:04:15.340 --> 00:04:18.360
Her name started with G...  Umm...

00:04:18.360 --> 00:04:20.950
Oh yeah!  Goki Girl!

00:04:21.710 --> 00:04:23.400
Look at this.

00:04:24.930 --> 00:04:26.290
From Ghost Girl?

00:04:26.290 --> 00:04:30.150
She sent a message on a 
popular hacking forum.

00:04:30.420 --> 00:04:33.150
It says what she's offering in exchange.

00:04:33.470 --> 00:04:37.460
The backdoor to SOL Technologies' data bank.

00:04:37.970 --> 00:04:41.060
Ghost Girl vs Playmaker.

00:04:41.060 --> 00:04:42.440
That's right.

00:04:42.440 --> 00:04:45.320
They were fighting over me.

00:04:45.320 --> 00:04:47.070
Ai, come with me!

00:04:47.580 --> 00:04:50.420
No Ai, come with me!

00:04:50.610 --> 00:04:53.870
Sigh...  It's tough when you're popular.

00:04:54.290 --> 00:04:56.340
So what happened?

00:04:56.640 --> 00:04:58.820
You've accepted my challenge?

00:05:00.580 --> 00:05:04.190
It should have data about 
the incident ten years ago.

00:05:04.560 --> 00:05:06.550
Why don't you go there yourself?

00:05:07.370 --> 00:05:13.430
To be honest, I became interested in 
you after seeing your recent duel.

00:05:13.820 --> 00:05:15.560
Speed Duel!

00:05:17.020 --> 00:05:22.570
Open before me!  The circuit that connects 
to the unknown parallel universe!

00:05:22.770 --> 00:05:27.830
Appear, Link 3 Altergeist Primebanshee!

00:05:31.070 --> 00:05:36.950
Even if Playmaker has a special connection 
with LINK VRAINS' data material...

00:05:36.950 --> 00:05:42.690
...I'll have no problems if I drop his 
LP to 0 before he activates his Skill.

00:05:43.000 --> 00:05:45.660
I'll end you this turn!

00:05:45.880 --> 00:05:51.900
She tried a sneaky strategy again, so 
I decided to give her the ol' one-two!

00:05:51.900 --> 00:05:53.870
No one says “ol' one-two” anymore.

00:05:53.870 --> 00:05:57.970
I tricked her with my excellent acting.

00:05:58.180 --> 00:06:00.220
This is bad, Playmaker!

00:06:00.220 --> 00:06:04.800
We won't lose all our LP, 
but we'll lose most of it!

00:06:04.800 --> 00:06:07.710
This is bad!  Super bad!  It's all over!

00:06:07.710 --> 00:06:11.250
What's with that AI's horrible acting job?

00:06:11.700 --> 00:06:15.590
He thinks that horrible acting 
will get me to attack?

00:06:15.800 --> 00:06:19.020
I won't battle!  I end my turn!

00:06:19.020 --> 00:06:21.120
What?  Why?

00:06:21.120 --> 00:06:23.500
After I tried so hard?

00:06:24.060 --> 00:06:25.970
Your acting job stunk.

00:06:26.230 --> 00:06:29.180
She found out I was acting,

00:06:29.180 --> 00:06:33.320
but Playmaker was able to activate 
his Skill by taking my advice.

00:06:33.320 --> 00:06:36.200
I can pay 1000 LP to activate its effect!

00:06:36.410 --> 00:06:40.280
Good!  You can now activate Storm Access!

00:06:40.500 --> 00:06:43.750
Playmaker, draw a comeback card!

00:06:50.330 --> 00:06:53.320
Playmaker!  Activate your Skill!

00:06:56.030 --> 00:06:59.520
I couldn't stop him from 
activating his Skill!

00:07:00.660 --> 00:07:02.900
Hey, what are you doing?

00:07:03.200 --> 00:07:05.270
I'm saving Ghost Girl.

00:07:07.570 --> 00:07:08.670
Seems you're okay.

00:07:13.400 --> 00:07:15.380
Give us what you promised.

00:07:15.600 --> 00:07:16.860
Of course.

00:07:26.650 --> 00:07:31.860
You now have the backdoor to 
SOL Technologies' data bank.

00:07:32.440 --> 00:07:33.900
You're incredible!

00:07:33.900 --> 00:07:35.970
The master won because of you!

00:07:35.970 --> 00:07:39.520
Yup.  But the fun begins now.

00:07:39.520 --> 00:07:46.180
We invaded the deepest part of SOL 
Technologies where no one has gone before.

00:07:46.180 --> 00:07:49.020
You're always doing bad things.

00:07:49.020 --> 00:07:51.880
Don't say that.

00:07:52.360 --> 00:07:56.220
It's the schematics for SOL 
Technologies' mother computer.

00:07:56.920 --> 00:08:01.690
There must be a lead to the incident ten 
years ago at the center in the data bank.

00:08:01.890 --> 00:08:05.400
Deck set!  Into the VRAINS!

00:08:05.620 --> 00:08:09.000
Intruder in the mother computer!

00:08:09.000 --> 00:08:10.170
What?

00:08:10.170 --> 00:08:11.470
I'll put it on screen!

00:08:13.020 --> 00:08:14.540
P-Playmaker!

00:08:17.650 --> 00:08:18.710
Duelists?

00:08:20.680 --> 00:08:22.540
Found Playmaker.

00:08:22.940 --> 00:08:26.250
They're 100% AI duelists!

00:08:27.290 --> 00:08:29.700
They're going crazy!

00:08:34.110 --> 00:08:37.560
Hey, AIs?  Stop doing whatever you want.

00:08:37.800 --> 00:08:40.300
If you interfere, we will eliminate you.

00:08:40.950 --> 00:08:43.330
I'll take you on!

00:08:43.330 --> 00:08:45.940
Seize the wind, Playmaker!

00:08:46.160 --> 00:08:49.850
Activating Skill!  Storm Access!

00:08:51.620 --> 00:08:54.850
Appear!  The circuit that 
leads to the future!

00:08:55.380 --> 00:08:56.480
Link Summon!

00:08:56.750 --> 00:09:00.720
Appear, Link 3 Vector Square Fiend!

00:09:01.160 --> 00:09:02.050
Battle!

00:09:02.280 --> 00:09:04.160
Diabolic Spin!

00:09:10.320 --> 00:09:12.360
Here I go!

00:09:12.600 --> 00:09:16.860
Come out, the circuit of dreams and hope!

00:09:17.340 --> 00:09:18.950
Link Summon!

00:09:18.950 --> 00:09:24.360
Appear, Link 2 Trickstar Black Catbat!

00:09:25.540 --> 00:09:27.010
Final battle!

00:09:27.240 --> 00:09:33.900
Trickstar Black Catbat 
attacks AI No. 2 directly!

00:09:43.290 --> 00:09:44.560
There it is.

00:09:48.120 --> 00:09:52.740
Zaizen and Ghost Girl, why are you here?

00:09:52.960 --> 00:09:56.110
We're also interested in the data here.

00:09:56.320 --> 00:10:00.080
And this is a hard place to break into.

00:10:00.080 --> 00:10:03.080
I see.  I understand now.

00:10:03.080 --> 00:10:06.350
They used us as a decoy.

00:10:06.350 --> 00:10:09.820
I can't let you go any further.

00:10:10.060 --> 00:10:14.430
So you know what's stored here?

00:10:14.430 --> 00:10:18.400
I have the right to learn what's stored here.

00:10:18.660 --> 00:10:23.670
Playmaker, please give 
me that AI and back off.

00:10:23.670 --> 00:10:28.240
I promise to bring this incident 
to light and uncover the truth.

00:10:28.540 --> 00:10:33.020
No matter the reason, I won't 
let others handle this.

00:10:33.020 --> 00:10:37.950
But if you insist on getting 
involved, you know how to stop me.

00:10:37.950 --> 00:10:39.120
A duel?

00:10:39.120 --> 00:10:40.390
That's right.

00:10:40.390 --> 00:10:43.490
If you win, I'll accept your demands.

00:10:44.330 --> 00:10:47.630
Fine!  I challenge you to a duel!

00:10:47.900 --> 00:10:51.100
See?  They're fighting over me again!

00:10:51.320 --> 00:10:53.300
You're so popular!

00:10:53.520 --> 00:10:55.840
But it's tough for me.

00:10:55.840 --> 00:10:59.770
I don't want them to fight because of me!

00:10:59.770 --> 00:11:03.710
I want everyone to be at peace!

00:11:03.710 --> 00:11:06.750
You actually think that?

00:11:06.960 --> 00:11:08.960
I'm lying!

00:11:08.960 --> 00:11:12.720
Fight!  Fight and perish!

00:11:12.940 --> 00:11:15.250
There it is!  Your evil version!

00:11:20.320 --> 00:11:23.360
I Special Summon Tindangle Hound!

00:11:25.420 --> 00:11:27.430
What a scary pooch!

00:11:27.640 --> 00:11:32.180
Battle!  Decode Talker, 
attack Tindangle Hound!

00:11:32.180 --> 00:11:34.080
Decode End!

00:11:36.550 --> 00:11:40.080
But Tindangle Hound's effect activates!

00:11:40.660 --> 00:11:43.320
Appear, Tindangle Angel!

00:11:47.800 --> 00:11:50.390
Tindangle Angel's effect activates!

00:11:50.640 --> 00:11:56.090
I Special Summon Tindangle Hound from my 
graveyard in facedown defense position!

00:11:56.540 --> 00:11:59.100
Hell's guard dog protects an angel...

00:11:59.100 --> 00:12:02.760
Those monsters are like Akira and Aoi.

00:12:02.970 --> 00:12:05.050
The brother protects the sister.

00:12:05.050 --> 00:12:09.050
If the brother loses, the 
sister resurrects the brother.

00:12:09.050 --> 00:12:11.600
A siblings' bond is unbreakable.

00:12:11.600 --> 00:12:13.580
This is a tough combo.

00:12:13.800 --> 00:12:17.550
What will you do, Playmaker?

00:12:18.170 --> 00:12:21.600
Zaizen, you're probably a good person.

00:12:22.100 --> 00:12:24.860
But you don't know me!

00:12:24.860 --> 00:12:28.960
You only know a fictional version of me!

00:12:29.460 --> 00:12:30.300
Link Summon!

00:12:30.580 --> 00:12:34.430
Appear!  Firewall Dragon!

00:12:34.890 --> 00:12:38.170
A Link 4 Cyberse has appeared!

00:12:38.440 --> 00:12:42.140
From my hand, I activate the 
spell card, Linkage Hole!

00:12:42.410 --> 00:12:48.310
I have Link 3 Decode Talker 
and Link 4 Firewall Dragon!

00:12:49.510 --> 00:12:52.150
Therefore, it destroys two monsters!

00:12:54.000 --> 00:12:56.220
He destroyed two at once!

00:12:56.220 --> 00:12:59.520
Appear, Tindangle Acute Cerberus!

00:13:03.530 --> 00:13:07.170
This pooch is scarier than the other one!

00:13:07.520 --> 00:13:09.170
Here I go, Playmaker!

00:13:09.460 --> 00:13:10.520
Battle!

00:13:10.520 --> 00:13:15.280
Acute Cerberus attacks Firewall Dragon!

00:13:15.280 --> 00:13:17.650
Acute Math Blaze!

00:13:22.240 --> 00:13:25.480
Can you turn this around?

00:13:25.760 --> 00:13:30.660
If you're that worried, then 
think about your new home.

00:13:31.880 --> 00:13:38.400
You're fine if he breaks apart 
our passionate friendship?

00:13:38.400 --> 00:13:40.680
There's no friendship between us.

00:13:43.550 --> 00:13:46.140
You're colder than an AI.

00:13:46.500 --> 00:13:49.840
I don't need warmth from people.

00:13:49.840 --> 00:13:51.810
I feel so bad for you...

00:13:52.020 --> 00:13:53.040
That's right!

00:13:53.040 --> 00:13:56.010
He's the devil pretending to be human!

00:13:56.240 --> 00:13:58.080
That's going too far.

00:13:58.080 --> 00:14:01.990
He's just a little coldhearted.

00:14:02.200 --> 00:14:04.990
You've become quite cute.

00:14:04.990 --> 00:14:06.090
Well, whatever.

00:14:06.340 --> 00:14:08.830
Then what happened?

00:14:09.600 --> 00:14:12.620
If you're worried that I'll 
lose, you don't need to.

00:14:12.620 --> 00:14:16.170
Because I definitely won't lose.

00:14:16.540 --> 00:14:20.040
Not until I uncover the 
truth with my own hands.

00:14:20.980 --> 00:14:24.280
This deck contains my feelings 
of the past ten years.

00:14:24.780 --> 00:14:27.410
I will find the truth!

00:14:27.680 --> 00:14:28.750
I draw!

00:14:29.060 --> 00:14:31.980
That card will determine your destiny!

00:14:32.280 --> 00:14:34.220
I set a card.

00:14:34.580 --> 00:14:36.690
I end my turn.

00:14:36.940 --> 00:14:39.690
Looks like you can't do anything.

00:14:40.040 --> 00:14:42.660
But that is your destiny.

00:14:43.060 --> 00:14:45.140
Stop your revenge.

00:14:45.140 --> 00:14:49.410
Let me handle this, and 
return to your normal life.

00:14:49.410 --> 00:14:51.600
That's what's best for you.

00:14:51.820 --> 00:14:55.710
By being obsessed with the 
past, time is passing you by.

00:14:55.710 --> 00:15:00.340
Don't let happiness slip away 
right in front of your eyes.

00:15:00.920 --> 00:15:02.850
Just like I did...

00:15:03.060 --> 00:15:04.320
Brother!

00:15:05.940 --> 00:15:07.140
Aoi?

00:15:08.640 --> 00:15:12.800
Before this duel ends, I 
want to hear the true story.

00:15:12.800 --> 00:15:15.370
What happened ten years ago?

00:15:15.840 --> 00:15:18.560
It's called the "Lost Incident."

00:15:18.860 --> 00:15:23.030
Six children went missing one-by-one.

00:15:23.280 --> 00:15:26.740
No way!  Was it you, Playmaker?

00:15:27.470 --> 00:15:31.980
After we were kidnapped, we 
were imprisoned separately.

00:15:39.650 --> 00:15:43.250
The room contained nothing.

00:15:43.520 --> 00:15:46.360
Except for VR equipment.

00:15:48.140 --> 00:15:51.460
The VR showed a duel arena.

00:15:51.800 --> 00:15:55.530
We were forced to duel there.

00:15:56.110 --> 00:15:57.570
You lose!

00:16:05.700 --> 00:16:10.680
We could only eat, sleep and duel.

00:16:11.220 --> 00:16:15.860
Everything was based on dueling.

00:16:16.390 --> 00:16:20.270
If we don't win a duel, we don't get to eat.

00:16:22.660 --> 00:16:27.260
When could we leave?  How long could we live?

00:16:27.740 --> 00:16:32.470
We just kept dueling, worried 
because we knew nothing.

00:16:33.240 --> 00:16:36.940
But half a year later, the 
incident suddenly ended.

00:16:39.120 --> 00:16:41.150
You were rescued.

00:16:41.660 --> 00:16:43.980
We weren't saved!

00:16:44.260 --> 00:16:49.350
I have the right to know what 
the incident's mission was.

00:16:49.600 --> 00:16:53.670
#1: That incident tore apart my life.

00:16:53.670 --> 00:16:57.830
I'll learn the truth and reconnect 
my life that was torn apart!

00:16:58.080 --> 00:17:03.570
#2: That incident deeply 
hurt us and our families.

00:17:03.800 --> 00:17:07.300
Some still haven't recovered from the shock.

00:17:07.520 --> 00:17:12.780
I'll learn the truth for 
them and their families!

00:17:13.020 --> 00:17:14.250
#3!

00:17:14.660 --> 00:17:19.680
During those hellish days, when 
my heart was about to break...

00:17:19.900 --> 00:17:22.080
You...  Hey, you.

00:17:22.080 --> 00:17:23.700
Be strong.

00:17:24.560 --> 00:17:26.270
That voice again...

00:17:26.270 --> 00:17:27.850
Three.

00:17:27.850 --> 00:17:30.960
Don't forget to think of three things.

00:17:31.700 --> 00:17:34.770
By thinking, you can still live.

00:17:35.560 --> 00:17:42.260
Whoever kept encouraging me 
wasn't among the rescuees.

00:17:42.840 --> 00:17:48.250
If he's still captured, I have to rescue him!

00:17:49.010 --> 00:17:52.720
Zaizen, I don't have what you talked about.

00:17:53.020 --> 00:17:55.220
Since my life was cut short,

00:17:55.220 --> 00:18:00.400
I have no future to talk about with 
my friends or irreplaceable moments.

00:18:01.760 --> 00:18:03.370
After the incident...

00:18:03.370 --> 00:18:07.830
To heal the wounds in my heart, 
I received treatment for years.

00:18:10.600 --> 00:18:14.340
I also tried hard to forget that incident.

00:18:15.560 --> 00:18:18.310
But no matter how much time passed...

00:18:21.560 --> 00:18:23.980
I couldn't forget.

00:18:23.980 --> 00:18:29.050
Those horrible memories were burned 
into my eyes, feasting on my heart.

00:18:29.050 --> 00:18:31.960
It became my flesh and blood 
that I couldn't dig out.

00:18:32.400 --> 00:18:38.180
When I realized that, I decided 
to face my own destiny.

00:18:40.320 --> 00:18:42.300
Firewall Dragon's effect!

00:18:43.060 --> 00:18:45.540
Emergency Escape!

00:18:45.780 --> 00:18:51.320
I return Tindangle Hound and Tindangle 
Angel from your graveyard to your hand.

00:18:52.510 --> 00:18:53.770
Battle!

00:18:53.770 --> 00:18:55.350
Firewall Dragon!

00:18:55.910 --> 00:18:59.090
Attack Tindangle Acute Cerberus!

00:19:00.290 --> 00:19:02.790
Tempest Attack!

00:19:14.380 --> 00:19:15.670
Brother!

00:19:17.360 --> 00:19:18.670
Brother...

00:19:19.000 --> 00:19:20.500
I'm fine.

00:19:20.960 --> 00:19:23.720
As promised, I'm taking the data.

00:19:26.580 --> 00:19:28.980
Ai, eat as much as you want.

00:19:29.450 --> 00:19:31.820
I'll eat everything!

00:19:34.620 --> 00:19:39.900
Zaizen, stay away from 
the incident and from me.

00:19:40.640 --> 00:19:41.840
Playmaker!

00:19:43.260 --> 00:19:48.230
If your Firewall attacked me 
directly earlier, you would've won.

00:19:48.800 --> 00:19:50.200
So why?

00:19:51.760 --> 00:19:58.760
Tindangle Hound and Tindangle Angel 
have the power to protect each other.

00:19:58.760 --> 00:20:01.810
They represent you two.

00:20:03.140 --> 00:20:07.280
You two shouldn't be 
resting in the graveyard.

00:20:07.700 --> 00:20:11.980
My revenge shouldn't drag 
you into the darkness.

00:20:12.380 --> 00:20:16.000
You should walk where there's light.

00:20:18.260 --> 00:20:22.570
Everyone, bye bAi!  Get it?

00:20:24.740 --> 00:20:28.540
Kusanagi, analyze it immediately.

00:20:30.030 --> 00:20:31.780
This one!

00:20:33.460 --> 00:20:37.780
Dr. Kogami.  Kiyoshi Kogami.

00:20:37.780 --> 00:20:40.520
Planned and executed the Hanoi Project.

00:20:41.740 --> 00:20:43.360
What's this?

00:20:45.010 --> 00:20:46.300
No way!

00:20:46.300 --> 00:20:47.440
What?

00:20:47.860 --> 00:20:51.160
Seven years ago, Dr. Kogami...

00:20:51.800 --> 00:20:53.820
...died.

00:20:54.840 --> 00:20:57.370
That's what our master experienced?

00:20:57.580 --> 00:21:03.220
That's why he became a bit coldhearted.

00:21:03.440 --> 00:21:06.540
What will the master do now?

00:21:06.540 --> 00:21:08.410
That's the thing.

00:21:08.410 --> 00:21:13.620
Since the doctor is dead, there's no one 
who knows the truth about the incident.

00:21:13.620 --> 00:21:17.250
I wonder what Yusaku will do.

00:21:20.600 --> 00:21:22.730
We still have a lead.

00:21:25.130 --> 00:21:26.460
Revolver.

00:21:26.720 --> 00:21:29.470
He's the leader of the Knights of Hanoi.

00:21:29.470 --> 00:21:31.560
He must know something.

00:21:31.560 --> 00:21:35.040
But he hasn't shown up recently.

00:21:36.140 --> 00:21:40.010
He's not the type who'd just disappear.

00:21:54.400 --> 00:22:01.120
The final battle for humanity's 
future will begin soon.

00:22:24.500 --> 00:22:27.540
Dance!  Strike with your heels

00:22:27.770 --> 00:22:31.050
Scream!  You Gotta Go  Raise your voice

00:22:31.470 --> 00:22:34.680
Sing!  Unleash your existence

00:22:34.970 --> 00:22:38.720
Get Away!  Until you surpass your limits

00:22:40.610 --> 00:22:42.610
Try It over and over

00:22:44.350 --> 00:22:50.770
In this world that spreads forever

00:22:51.120 --> 00:22:57.710
The timeline flows forever

00:22:58.000 --> 00:23:00.270
Nothing is certain

00:23:00.400 --> 00:23:01.950
In these isolated times

00:23:02.230 --> 00:23:03.710
Set Yourself Free without hesitation

00:23:03.940 --> 00:23:05.480
Cuz We Still Believin' Magic

00:23:05.700 --> 00:23:08.870
The traces we leave behind

00:23:09.010 --> 00:23:12.440
The traces we leave behind

00:23:12.640 --> 00:23:16.410
The miracles we create

00:23:16.670 --> 00:23:18.650
Never Give Up Never!

00:23:18.650 --> 00:23:22.500
I won't give up  Never Give Up Never!

00:23:36.410 --> 00:23:40.380
An ominous ring appeared above LINK VRAINS.

00:23:40.380 --> 00:23:43.510
It's like a solar eclipse.

00:23:43.510 --> 00:23:49.370
Ancient people thought eclipses 
were offerings from God.

00:23:49.370 --> 00:23:51.580
But this is virtual reality.

00:23:51.580 --> 00:23:55.350
If there is a God, who is it?

00:23:55.350 --> 00:23:59.280
I won't let the Lost Incident 
be buried in darkness!

